<title>USA: Scotsman begins $43/shr Kysor tender offer.</title>
<headline>Scotsman begins $43/shr Kysor tender offer.</headline>
<dateline>VERNON HILLS, Ill. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotsman Industries Inc said Friday it has commenced a previously announced tender offer for the common shares and series A convertible voting preferred stock of Kysor Industrial Corp at $43.00 a share in cash.</p>
<p>The tender offer follows an agreement and plan of merger between the two companies reached February 2, 1997.  The tender offer is scheduled to expire on March 7, 1997.</p>
<p>Scotsman and Kysor make commercial refrigeration products and systems.</p>
<p>Shares of Kysor closed at 42-1/2 yesterday.</p>
